Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.8620544Z                      "name": "Token-Permissions",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.8621188Z                      "helpUri": "https://github.com/ossf/scorecard/blob/ea7e27ed41b76ab879c862fa0ca4cc9c61764ee4/docs/checks.md#token-permissions",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.8621738Z                      "shortDescription": {
