Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.9181025Z                      "helpUri": "https://github.com/ossf/scorecard/blob/ea7e27ed41b76ab879c862fa0ca4cc9c61764ee4/docs/checks.md#security-policy",
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.9181109Z                      "shortDescription": {
Scorecard analysis	Run analysis	2026-05-11T21:18:16.9181210Z                         "text": "Security-Policy"
